      "en": "“Oh that my anguish were weighed, and all my calamity laid in the balances!",
      "ko": "나의 분한을 달아 보며 나의 모든 재앙을 저울에 둘 수 있으면",
      "source_text_hash": "06059325bbec6ab13f7ccb092af088c3ce952b4c485753b27be47ef6124cd22b",
      "translation_text_hash": "eb0d999e55dcd547c72cfc56ab34aeec18350a127686da5942b2feec4a681f61",
