      "en": "Does the wild donkey bray when he has grass? Or does the ox low over his fodder?",
      "ko": "들나귀가 풀이 있으면 어찌 울겠으며 소가 꼴이 있으면 어찌 울겠느냐",
      "source_text_hash": "3b928d5ad3e8be998936457a4c29957020091a3276c950d38f3ed66bee66ee7b",
      "translation_text_hash": "34e706232f2a7ab1ec644b94c44f42891e092b64b5a21f4bbcfaaeec7f9632ec",
