      "en": "Can that which has no flavor be eaten without salt? Or is there any taste in the white of an egg?",
      "ko": "싱거운 것이 소금 없이 먹히겠느냐 닭의 알 흰자위가 맛이 있겠느냐",
      "source_text_hash": "cbb251f2b34d2f266997db10fa3673d292b83a6124d4ec38f269e7e7da5887df",
      "translation_text_hash": "d4319c1db13480b5b3a302eaf51d7029555c8b1ccfdba7c4a4157111861b36f4",
