      "en": "My soul refuses to touch them. They are as loathsome food to me.",
      "ko": "이런 것을 만지기도 내 마음이 싫어하나니 못된 식물같이 여김이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "742fe38086ebdb4fbf5ca68e762de571d03a4914b2cc1e5d6700b39f632fe3f6",
      "translation_text_hash": "fb2bd95eec8c0ebd9fb5652489d6463a37ed1887babb570143a07b3d99cbeb72",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
