      "en": "even that it would please God to crush me; that he would let loose his hand, and cut me off!",
      "ko": "이는 곧 나를 멸하시기를 기뻐하사 그 손을 들어 나를 끊으실 것이라",
      "source_text_hash": "b5a4abe0d28e46806e08e646a1b2aabd574146d5ba16b2a2d09149757f15966a",
      "translation_text_hash": "0caa1b57dcad31435fd8a0490e46a1bb6ce62843fb45e29b197a3f04d2ee76ba",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
