      "en": "“To him who is ready to faint, kindness should be shown from his friend; even to him who forsakes the fear of the Almighty.",
      "ko": "피곤한 자 곧 전능자, 경외하는 일을 폐한 자를 그 벗이 불쌍히 여길 것이어늘",
      "source_text_hash": "1d5acd6509d4256a7819686746b552a9fef49048985b5121dfdbc532c2bac745",
      "translation_text_hash": "cba51013deb24fef2ad1be6f3f3e43f17bd36a005fe114c9bb105ddcdd1a5f7d",
